<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Rosebank Gospel Hall App for Android | From Gravel Hill Enterprises</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A free Android app for Rosebank Gospel Hall in Rosebank, Prince Edward Island. Read, watch and listen to messages, save posts for offline reading, and play audio with the screen off.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://fromgravelhill.ca/rosebank/">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="From Gravel Hill Enterprises">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Rosebank Gospel Hall App for Android">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Free Android app: messages, video and audio from Rosebank Gospel Hall. No accounts, ads or tracking.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://fromgravelhill.ca/rosebank/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://fromgravelhill.ca/assets/images/rosebank/og-rosebank.png">
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Rosebank Gospel Hall App: free for Android">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#4a1623">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light dark;
      --bg: #fcfaf9; --fg: #211a1b; --muted: #5d4f52; --line: #e6dcdd;
      --panel: #f6eeee; --accent: #6e2536; --accent-fg: #ffffff; --gold: #b8861b;
      --link: #6e2536;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #1b1214; --fg: #f1e7e8; --muted: #c2b0b3; --line: #3b2a2e;
        --panel: #251a1d; --accent: #e8c36a; --accent-fg: #2a1a05; --gold: #e8c36a;
        --link: #f0cf85;
      }
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 72px; }
    body {
      margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
      font: 17px/1.65 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    a { color: var(--link); }
    .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    header.top {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; background: var(--bg);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    header.top .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; min-height: 56px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .brand { font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg); }
    nav { display: flex; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: .95rem; }
    nav a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); }
    nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible { color: var(--fg); text-decoration: underline; }
    .hero { padding: 48px 0 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 220px; gap: 36px; align-items: center; }
    .hero img { width: 220px; height: 220px; border-radius: 50%; display: block; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .lead { margin: 0 0 22px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 56ch; }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block; padding: .7rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--accent); background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-fg);
    }
    .btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--link); }
    .btn:focus-visible, a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .quick { margin: 18px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; }
    .quick li::before { content: "\2713\00a0"; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
    section { padding: 36px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0 36px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .features li { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .features strong { display: block; }
    .features span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .96rem; }
    ol.steps { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.3rem; }
    ol.steps li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .note { background: var(--panel); border-left: 4px solid var(--gold); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 18px; font-size: .97rem; }
    dl.facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 9rem 1fr; gap: 10px 16px; margin: 0; }
    dl.facts dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
    dl.facts dd { margin: 0; }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 24px 0 40px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .94rem; text-align: center; }
    code { background: var(--panel); padding: .1em .35em; border-radius: 4px; font-size: .92em; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero img { width: 140px; height: 140px; order: -1; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      dl.facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
      dl.facts dd { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/rosebank/">Rosebank Gospel Hall App</a>
      <nav aria-label="Page sections">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#install">Install</a>
        <a href="#verify">Verify</a>
        <a href="#privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/">fromgravelhill.ca</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Rosebank Gospel Hall App</h1>
        <p class="lead">A free Android app for Rosebank Gospel Hall, a Gospel Hall Assembly in Rosebank, Prince Edward Island. Read, watch and listen to the messages from <a href="https://rosebankgospelhall.ca/" rel="noopener">rosebankgospelhall.ca</a> in one place.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/Atrion/rosebank-gospel-hall-website-app/releases/latest" rel="noopener">Download for Android</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#install">How to install</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="quick">
          <li>Free</li>
          <li>Android 8.0 or newer</li>
          <li>No accounts, ads or tracking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/images/rosebank/logo.png" width="220" height="220" alt="Rosebank Gospel Hall logo">
    </div>

    <section id="features" aria-labelledby="h-features">
      <h2 id="h-features">What it does</h2>
      <ul class="features">
        <li><strong>Posts</strong><span>Browse everything with filters for each category and tag, search, and sorting.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Listen and Watch</strong><span>Separate tabs for audio and video, each with its own filters.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Background audio</strong><span>Keeps playing with the screen off, with lock-screen controls, speed and skip buttons.</span></li>
        <li><strong>In-app video</strong><span>YouTube and other videos play full screen inside the app.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Saved posts</strong><span>Save posts to read again later, even without a connection.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Info pages</strong><span>What We Believe, Free Food Hamper, Resources, and Contact with call, email and directions.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Reading comfort</strong><span>Light, dark or system theme, and adjustable text size.</span></li>
        <li><strong>New post alerts</strong><span>Optional notification when a new post is published.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;color:var(--muted)">Content is read from the assembly's website, so anything published there appears in the app without an update.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="install" aria-labelledby="h-install">
      <h2 id="h-install">How to install</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>On your Android phone, open the <a href="https://github.com/Atrion/rosebank-gospel-hall-website-app/releases/latest" rel="noopener">latest release page</a>.</li>
        <li>Under Assets, tap the file ending in <code>.apk</code>.</li>
        <li>Open the downloaded file. If Android asks, allow installs from your browser.</li>
        <li>Updates install over the top and keep your saved posts.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="note">The app is not on Google Play yet. It needs Android 8.0 or newer.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="verify" aria-labelledby="h-verify">
      <h2 id="h-verify">Check your download</h2>
      <p>Each release lists a SHA-256 checksum for its APK. After downloading, compare it with your file using the <a href="/checksum/">checksum tool</a> (the file never leaves your device), or read <a href="/checksums/">how to verify downloads</a>. If the values differ, do not install the file.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="h-privacy">
      <h2 id="h-privacy">Privacy</h2>
      <p>The app has no accounts, no advertising and no analytics. Saved posts and settings stay on your phone. It only connects to rosebankgospelhall.ca and the video services used by posts (such as YouTube), and those services may see ordinary connection details like your IP address.</p>
      <p>Permissions: internet access, notifications (optional, asked inside the app) and background audio playback.</p>
      <p><a href="/rosebank-gospel-hall-app/privacy/">Read the full privacy policy</a></p>
    </section>

    <section id="about" aria-labelledby="h-about">
      <h2 id="h-about">About</h2>
      <dl class="facts">
        <dt>Built by</dt><dd>From Gravel Hill Enterprises (<a href="https://fromgravelhill.ca/">fromgravelhill.ca</a>)</dd>
        <dt>Price</dt><dd>Free</dd>
        <dt>Source code</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/Atrion/rosebank-gospel-hall-website-app" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>, Apache License 2.0</dd>
        <dt>Content</dt><dd>Messages, articles, images and the Rosebank Gospel Hall name and logo belong to Rosebank Gospel Hall and their respective authors.</dd>
        <dt>Questions</dt><dd><a href="mailto:info@fromgravelhill.ca">info@fromgravelhill.ca</a></dd>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">&copy; <span id="year"></span> From Gravel Hill Enterprises &middot; <a href="https://fromgravelhill.ca/">fromgravelhill.ca</a> &middot; <a href="/rosebank-gospel-hall-app/privacy/">Privacy</a></div>
  </footer>
  <script>document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>
